+- **`application/application_handler.gleam`** — `is_honeypot_filled` / `is_timing_suspicious` (pub, reused as-is); the fake-success bot path; `insert_erasure_token`'s `wisp.random_string(48)` mint.
+- **`application/form_view.gleam`** — `view_honeypot_field` / `view_timing_field` / `current_unix_ms` (reuse; do not reimplement); the head pattern (fonts.css + form.css, no analytics on this surface); `h-12` full-width rows, `max-w-[48rem]`.
