+- **Guarded-update SQL** (`update_reference_call_status.sql`, `append_reference_call_attempt.sql`) — every mutation is `UPDATE ... WHERE <identity> AND <expected state> RETURNING`; 0 rows = stand down.
+- **Squirrel traps (field notes, 3 sightings):** `run_squirrel.sh` sources `.env` and points at STAGING — run `gleam run -m squirrel` directly against the local test DB (`make test-db-up` first); revert the whitespace-only churn it re-emits in `server/src/ai/sql.gleam` after each run.
